<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-073" chapter-id="c-jinshu-073-jin098-huanwen-opening" source-id="s-jinshu-073-jin098-huanwen-opening">
  <p id="c-jinshu-073-jin098-huanwen-opening:recommendation" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">見<persName id="c-jinshu-073-jin098-huanwen-opening:recommendation:m0001" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>總角之中，便期之以遠略，因言于<persName id="c-jinshu-073-jin098-huanwen-opening:recommendation:m0018" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA">成帝</persName>曰：「<persName id="c-jinshu-073-jin098-huanwen-opening:recommendation:m0023" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>有英雄之才，願陛下勿以常人遇之，常婿畜之，宜委以方邵之任，必有弘濟艱難之勳。」</p>
</text>
